2:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/es/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Uae\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/es/uae/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Camello de los EAU\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/es/uae/uae-camel-dot-to-dot-puzzle/\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"Camello de los EAU\",\"description\":\"La joroba de un camello almacena grasa, no agua. Los contadores pacientes de 6 a 10 años pueden revelar este ícono del desierto a través de 105 puntos en un PDF imprimible gratuito.\",\"educationalUse\":\"Fine motor skills, number sequencing\"}"}}],["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"breadcrumb","aria-label":"Miga de pan","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/es/","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":14,"height":14,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-house","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","5wwlr5",{"d":"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"}],["$","path","1d0kgt",{"d":"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"}],"$undefined"]}]," ","Hogar"]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":" › "}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/es/uae/","children":"Uae"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":" › "}],["$","span",null,{"aria-current":"page","children":"Camello de los EAU"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"maxWidth":1180,"margin":"0 auto","padding":"0 24px 20px"},"children":null}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-page-layout section","style":{"paddingTop":0},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-card","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"","srcSet":"$undefined","sizes":"$undefined","alt":"Camello del desierto caminando sobre la arena, su contorno llevado por 105 puntos imprimibles","width":540,"height":420,"loading":"eager","fetchPriority":"high","decoding":"async","className":"$undefined","style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto","display":"block","borderRadius":16}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-side-ad","children":null}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-details-col","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["Free ","Uae"," Printable"]}],["$","h1",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem)"},"children":"Camello de los EAU Dot-to-Dot Printable"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","fontSize":"1.05rem","lineHeight":1.65,"margin":"14px 0 20px"},"children":"Conecta 105 puntos para revelar un camello caminando sobre la arena, uno de los símbolos más perdurables de la vida en los EAU y en la península arábiga. Con más puntos que nuestros otros rompecabezas de los EAU, este es un paso adelante en el desafío, ideal para niños listos para pasar más allá de las hojas más fáciles mientras siguen aprendiendo algo real sobre la vida en el desierto."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-chips","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Ages:"," ",""]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Dots:"," 1–",0]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip chip--free","children":"100% Free"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"16px 0"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":8,"fontSize":"0.9rem"},"children":"Difficulty"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"display":"flex","alignItems":"center","gap":10},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"difficulty","role":"img","aria-label":"Dificultad 1 de 3","style":{"margin":0},"children":[["$","span","1",{"className":"on"}],["$","span","2",{"className":""}],["$","span","3",{"className":""}]]}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.85rem","fontWeight":800,"color":"var(--muted)"},"children":"Easy"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"fun-fact-box","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.3rem"},"aria-hidden":"true","children":"!"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fun fact:"}]," ","La joroba del camello no almacena agua: almacena grasa, que su cuerpo puede convertir en energía y hasta en agua cuando escasea la comida."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"20px 0 16px"},"children":null}],["$","p",null,{"className":"asset-note","children":"Printable PDF path is not present in the export JSON."}],"$L10",["$","$L11",null,{"title":"Camello de los EAU Conecta los Puntos Imprimible - PDF Gratis","imageUrl":"","compact":true}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","color":"var(--muted)","marginTop":10,"lineHeight":1.5},"children":"No sign-up needed. Opens as a PDF. Print on US Letter (8.5 × 11 inch) or A4 paper. Free for home and classroom use."}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/es/uae/","style":{"display":"inline-flex","alignItems":"center","gap":6,"marginTop":18,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#d94f70","textDecoration":"none"},"children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}]," Back to all ","Uae"," puzzles"]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"dot-guide","className":"section","style":{"paddingTop":0,"maxWidth":800,"margin":"0 auto","padding":"0 24px 48px"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem)","marginBottom":12},"children":["Camello de los EAU"," Dot-to-Dot Puzzle Guide"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":28},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Durante miles de años, el camello hizo posible la vida en el desierto: transportaba mercancías por dunas que ningún carro con ruedas podía cruzar y daba leche, lana y transporte a las comunidades beduinas mucho antes de que las carreteras y el aire acondicionado lo cambiaran todo. Hoy en los EAU se siguen criando camellos y celebrando carreras, y la leche de camello aparece en todo, desde lattes hasta tabletas de chocolate. Este puzle de 105 puntos es más largo que la mayoría de nuestras fichas…"}}],[["$","div","1–21",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["1–21"," — ","La cabeza y el cuello"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Empieza en el punto 1 y avanza hasta el punto 21 para dibujar el largo cuello curvado y la cabeza alerta. Los camellos llevan el cuello en una característica curva en S, así que anima a los niños a dejar que la línea suba y baje con naturalidad en vez de forzarla recta. Es un primer tramo largo, así que un pequeño descanso después es más que justo."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Los camellos tienen tres párpados y dos filas de pestañas largas que trabajan juntas para mantener la arena fuera de sus ojos durante una tormenta. También pueden cerrar por completo las fosas nasales, algo que ningún otro animal de carga tiene igual."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","22–42",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["22–42"," — ","La joroba"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Continúa del punto 22 al 42 para dar forma a la joroba alta y redondeada. Es una curva muy agradable de dibujar: mejor un solo trazo suave que varios pequeños, porque las líneas entrecortadas tienden a aplanar la forma de la joroba."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"El dromedario, o camello de una joroba, es la especie que se encuentra en los Emiratos Árabes Unidos y en la península arábiga en general. El camello bactriano, de dos jorobas, es una especie diferente, originaria de Asia Central y no del Golfo Pérsico. Para más información, consulta <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dromedary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">la entrada sobre el dromedario en Wikipedia</a> ."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","43–63",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["43–63"," — ","La línea del lomo"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Traza los puntos 43 a 63 para completar la línea del lomo, incluida la hondonada después de la joroba. Acertar con esa hondonada — ni demasiado profunda ni demasiado plana — es lo que hace que la silueta se lea como un camello y no como una línea llena de bultos. Tómate esta sección con calma."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Un camello adulto puede beber alrededor de 150 litros de agua en solo unos minutos cuando por fin llega a una fuente, reponiendo de una sentada lo perdido en días de viaje."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","64–84",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["64–84"," — ","Las patas"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Une los puntos 64 a 84 para dibujar las cuatro patas largas y robustas. Esta sección tiene más cambios de dirección que las anteriores, así que es un buen momento para ir más despacio y comprobar dos veces cada número antes de trazar la siguiente línea."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Los camellos caminan moviendo ambas patas del mismo lado del cuerpo a la vez, una marcha llamada andadura. Esto les confiere un característico movimiento de balanceo, razón por la cual uno de los primeros apodos del camello fue «barco del desierto». Las carreras de camellos siguen siendo un deporte importante en los Emiratos Árabes Unidos; para más información, consulta <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camel_racing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">la entrada sobre carre…"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","85–105",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["85–105"," — ","Los pies y la cola"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Termina el puzle uniendo los puntos 85 a 105 para añadir los pies anchos y la cola. Quedan veintiún puntos: un final fuerte asienta de verdad todo el dibujo, así que mano firme hasta el último punto."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Los pies del camello se ensanchan al pisar, repartiendo su peso para no hundirse en la arena blanda, de forma muy parecida a una raqueta de nieve. Es una de las varias características que hacen al camello tan apto para viajar por el desierto."]}]]}]]}]]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section","style":{"paddingTop":8},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["More free ","Uae"," printables"]}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem)"},"children":"You might also like"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-grid","children":[["$","article","burj-al-arab-dot-to-dot-puzzle",{"className":"puzzle-card","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/es/uae/burj-al-arab-dot-to-dot-puzzle/","className":"puzzle-image","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"","srcSet":"$undefined","sizes":"$undefined","alt":"Hotel Burj Al Arab con forma de vela surgiendo al unir 66 puntos en una ficha de monumentos","width":420,"height":320,"loading":"lazy","fetchPriority":"auto","decoding":"async","className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"puzzle-category","children":"Uae"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Burj Al Árab"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-meta","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":""}],["$","span